  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The JPO will be working under the overall authority of the Assistant Director-General for Social and Human Sciences (ADG/SHS), and under the direct supervision of the Chief of the Bioethics and Ethics of Science Section.Within the frameworks of UNESCO&apos;s Medium-Term Strategy (C/4), the approved Programme and Budget (C/5), and the 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development, the Bioethics and Ethics of Science and Technology Section performs the major functions of laboratory of ideas, standard-setter, clearing house, capacity-builder, and catalyst for international cooperation.</narrative>
